1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:05,336
Bhaiya, mera restaurant kholne ka sapna hai, par dukaan ka kiraya 50 hazaar!

2
00:00:05,636 --> 00:00:11,003
Neetu, dukaan ki zaroorat hi nahi! Ghar se cloud kitchen chala, online order le!

3
00:00:11,303 --> 00:00:13,683
Bina dukaan ke restaurant? Wo kaise?

4
00:00:13,983 --> 00:00:19,636
Food license, bada chulha, packing, aur Zomato-Swiggy pe listing. 50 hazaar mein.

5
00:00:19,936 --> 00:00:25,344
Menu chhota rakh. Bas 5-6 dish, par swaad aisa ki rating 4 se upar rahe.

6
00:00:25,894 --> 00:00:29,756
Madam, teen order taiyaar hain? Customer phone pe phone kar raha hai!

7
00:00:30,056 --> 00:00:34,262
Ye lo, rajma chawal. 180 ka order, garam pahunchana!

8
00:00:34,562 --> 00:00:39,305
Roz 40 order, commission ke baad bhi ₹1,500 se ₹2,000 roz.

9
00:00:39,605 --> 00:00:44,720
Apna WhatsApp number bhi dibbe pe likh. Seedha order, koi commission nahi!

10
00:00:45,020 --> 00:00:48,847
Bina dukaan ka restaurant, superhit! Neetu ki life set!
